{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:39:04+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:39:04+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bavarian Nordic A/S","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"Denmark","city":"Hellerup","website":"https://www.bavarian-nordic.com","employees":1906,"summary":"Bavarian Nordic A/S develops, manufactures, and supplies life-saving vaccines. The company offers non-replicating smallpox and monkeypox vaccines under the IMVAMUNE, IMVANEX, and JYNNEOS names; rabies vaccine for human use under the Rabipur/RabAvert name; tick-borne encephalitis vaccine under the Encepur name; Vaxchora, an oral vaccine for immunization against cholera; and Vivotif/Typhoral, an oral vaccine for immunization against typhoid fever. It is also developing MVA-BN WEV, that is in phase 2 trial for the treatment of encephalitis viruses. It operates in the United States, Denmark, Canada, France, Germany, Singapore, England, Finland, Switzerland, Japan, Austria, Italy, Spain, Taiwan, Saudi Arabia, Australia, and internationally. Bavarian Nordic A/S was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Hellerup, Denmark.","exchange":"Copenhagen","currency":"DKK","financial_currency":"DKK","summary_fr":"Bavarian Nordic A/S développe, fabrique et fournit des vaccins vitaux. La société propose des vaccins contre la variole et la monkeypox sous les noms IMVAMUNE, IMVANEX et JYNNEOS; le vaccin contre la rage à usage humain sous le nom Rabipur / RabAvert; le vaccin contre l'encéphalite à tiques sous le nom Encepur; Vaxchora, un vaccin oral pour la vaccination contre le choléra; et Vivotif / Typhoral, un vaccin oral pour la vaccination contre la fièvre typhoïde. Il développe également MVA-BN WEV, qui est en essai de phase 2 pour le traitement des virus de l'encéphalite."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":17755105280,"shares_outstanding":74601281,"trailing_pe":12.205129,"fo